 Tahoe (26.5.2) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAn untyped rest parameter in a GDScript function will produce the `UNTYPED_DECLARATION` warning twice:\n\n<img width=\"591\" height=\"216\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ced6b88d-1345-456c-9537-ef1bdf4d5056\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a GDScript file with the following code:\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc my_function(..._var_args) -> void:\n\tpass\n```\nEnsure that `UNTYPED_DECLARATION` is set to warn in the project settings.\nNote that the warning list displays the warning twice, with identical messages:\n```\n[Ignore] Line 3 (UNTYPED_DECLARATION): Parameter \"_var_args\" has no static type.\n[Ignore] Line 3 (UNTYPED_DECLARATION): Parameter \"_var_args\" has no static type.\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee above.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/